# Onde Code

Fine-tune, manage and deploy models without leaving your editor.

Onde Code is a coding agent for your model work on [Onde Inference](https://ondeinference.com). It writes and runs the fine-tuning, model management and deploy code in your repo, and it works in any [Agent Client Protocol](https://agentclientprotocol.com) (ACP) editor or in the terminal. It is free and Apache-2.0. Get an app key at [ondeinference.com](https://ondeinference.com).

## `@ondeinference/${node_pkg}`

This package is one of the platform-specific binaries behind [`@ondeinference/onde-code`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ondeinference/onde-code). You usually do not need to install it directly.

Install the main package and npm will pull in the right binary for your OS and architecture:

```sh
npm install -g @ondeinference/onde-code
```

## Other install methods

| Channel | Command |
|---------|---------|
| npm | `npm install -g @ondeinference/onde-code` |
| GitHub release | archives and `checksums.txt` on the [releases page](https://github.com/ondeinference/onde-code/releases) |
| winget | `winget install OndeInference.OndeCode` |

## Platform support

| Platform | Architecture | Package |
|----------|--------------|---------|
| macOS | Apple Silicon (arm64) | [`@ondeinference/onde-code-darwin-arm64`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ondeinference/onde-code-darwin-arm64) |
| macOS | Intel (x64) | [`@ondeinference/onde-code-darwin-x64`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ondeinference/onde-code-darwin-x64) |
| Linux | x64 | [`@ondeinference/onde-code-linux-x64`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ondeinference/onde-code-linux-x64) |
| Linux | arm64 | [`@ondeinference/onde-code-linux-arm64`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ondeinference/onde-code-linux-arm64) |
| Windows | x64 | [`@ondeinference/onde-code-windows-x64`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ondeinference/onde-code-windows-x64) |

